6054..6130 Comment "/// Function extensionality from a homotopy, through the path space: the map"
6131..6205 Comment "/// takes a point to both functions\' results there and the homotopy\'s path"
6206..6282 Comment "/// between them. Its first end reads the first result, a returned call, and"
6283..6357 Comment "/// a returned call is the call it holds, so the end is `f`; the second is"
6358..6366 Comment "/// `g`."
